  "instructions": [
    "Bring the dashi broth to a boil in a large pot",
    "Add the noodles to the pot and cook for 5 minutes",
    "Remove the noodles from the pot and set aside",
    "Add the mirin, soy sauce, and sake to the pot and stir to combine",
    "Add the sliced ham to the pot and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the cooked noodles back to the pot and stir to combine with the ham and sauce",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving dish and garnish with chopped green onions and sesame seeds",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy"
